   rim rings         → TorusGeometry thin, #7fa8b8
   tube bottom disc  → CircleGeometry(0.30) glass
   hex foot          → 2 x CylinderGeometry(radialSegments 6) #d8e4ea
   oil column        → CylinderGeometry(0.27,0.27,4.55) vertexColor gradient, 0.92
